    <string name="band_normal_hint">%s 属于低频段，覆盖稳定但速度偏慢，适合室内和远距离使用。</string>
    <string name="band_china_mobile_5g">n28 (700M, 共享广电), n41 (2.6G), n79 (4.9G)</string>
    <string name="band_china_mobile_4g">B3 (1800M), B8 (900M), B34 (1900M), B38~B41 (2.6G, 部分重耕5G)</string>
    <string name="band_china_mobile_feature">n41 主力 5G 兼顾 4G；与广电共享 n28 广覆盖；n79 用于热点容量补充</string>
